  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br />Clearly,&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced></mrow> </math> is injective either for <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, for <math><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Range of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
